# HR Dashboard

## Project Overview

This dashboard was developed to help organizations monitor employee performance and workforce trends through interactive visualizations.

## Business Problem

Human Resource departments often manage large volumes of employee information, making it difficult to identify workforce trends and monitor overall performance.

This dashboard transforms HR data into meaningful insights that support strategic decision-making.

## Objectives

- Monitor employee performance
- Analyse workforce demographics
- Track departmental performance
- Improve reporting efficiency

## Tools Used

- Power BI
- SQL Server
- Excel
- Power Query
- DAX

## Features

- Employee overview
- Department analysis
- Performance metrics
- Interactive filtering
- KPI cards

## Skills Demonstrated

- Data Cleaning
- Data Modelling
- DAX Calculations
- Dashboard Design
- Business Intelligence Reporting

